␀␀␀␀c6␀␀identify␀␀␀␀rehearse␀␀␀␀boot␀␀␀␀svos: commands
svos:   svos status            what the device sees
svos:   svos tasks             CPU share of each task over 2 s
svos:   svos wifi on|off|scan  switch Wi-Fi, list networks in range
svos:   svos sd test           write, read back and delete a test file
svos:   svos petdoku           time puzzle generation per size
svos:   svos c6 identify       which firmware the Wi-Fi chip runs
svos:   svos c6 rehearse       reach its download mode, write nothing
svos:   svos c6 install        replace ESP-AT with ESP-Hosted
svos:   svos c6 boot           BOOT button is being held
svos:   svos c6 at A;B;...     send AT commands (no spaces), log replies
svos:   svos camera on|off|wide|normal|fill  preview and its zoom
svos:   svos jpeg              colour round trip through encoder+decoder
svos:   svos lowpower on|off   switch Low Power Mode
svos:   svos survival on|off   switch Survival Mode (deep sleep when dark)
svos:   svos setup             run the setup assistant at next start
svos:   svos edition full|mini choose the edition
svos:   svos sort              file SD card downloads into place
svos:   svos video PATH        frames, sound and its level in a video
svos:   svos tap X Y [ms]      touch the screen
svos:   svos swipe X1 Y1 X2 Y2 [ms]  drag a finger
svos:   svos shot [quality]    screenshot as base64 JPEG
svos:   svos time UNIX         set the clock (UTC seconds)
svos:   svos power             short press of the power button␀␀camera␀␀wide␀␀␀␀normal␀␀fill␀␀␀␀svos: camera start -> %s
