␀./main/ui/views/setup_wizard_view.cpp␀␀␀Your phone, off the grid.␀␀␀Build %s␀␀␀␀Get started␀Both have First Aid, the camera, voice memos, radio and Petdoku. You can run this setup again from Settings.␀␀␀␀Choose your setup␀␀␀With an SD card. Adds maps, Wikipedia, plants, the translator, music and files. Photos go to the card.␀␀Full␀␀␀␀No card needed. Photos and memos stay in the phone's own memory, which holds about 15 photos.␀␀␀Mini␀␀␀␀Maps and Wikipedia live on it. Any size works; 8 GB holds Czech maps and Wikipedia.␀Insert the SD card␀␀Pick now, download on a computer later.␀What goes on the card?␀␀MAPS␀␀␀␀No maps␀Czechia, detailed␀␀␀Whole world, overview␀␀␀WIKIPEDIA (TEXT, NO PICTURES)␀␀␀No Wikipedia␀␀␀␀Czech␀␀␀English␀Czech and English␀␀␀FIELD GUIDE␀No field guide␀␀World plants & fungi␀␀␀␀Open this page on a computer. Your picks are already ticked there.␀␀Get the files␀␀␀%s#content?maps=%s&wiki=%s&nature=%d␀␀␀␀QR code for %s failed
␀␀Download the files there.␀␀␀Copy them to the card, into any folder.␀Put the card back. The phone sorts the files by itself.␀The phone needs no network. Wi-Fi only sets the clock and stays off otherwise, which saves battery.␀Not now␀Set up Wi-Fi␀␀␀␀You're all set␀␀Start using SurvivalOS␀␀Maps, Wikipedia, camera, radio and music that work with no signal at all. A few questions and it is ready.␀␀Without a card you can still go on and add one later; the phone picks it up by itself.␀␀Swipe up from the bottom edge to go home.␀␀␀Swipe down from the top edge for Control Center.␀␀␀␀The leaf in Control Center is Low Power Mode. It also turns on by itself at 20%.␀␀␀␀Files copied to the card are sorted into place when it goes in.␀Not available yet: this switch does nothing␀The radio is LE only: no headphones or speakers␀Device name␀Paired Bluetooth devices␀␀␀␀Unpair␀␀Paired devices␀␀Brightness␀␀Screen brightness␀␀␀Screen␀␀Screen rotation␀%d deg␀␀Appearance␀␀Dark theme␀␀Changing the rotation angle may affect some application layouts.␀␀␀␀Display & Brightness␀␀␀␀0 deg␀␀␀90 deg␀␀180 deg␀270 deg␀Set WLAN hotspot␀␀␀␀WLAN hotspot settings␀␀␀Network name␀␀␀␀Security␀␀␀␀xinyuandianzi␀␀␀2.4 GHz and 5 GHz␀␀␀AP band␀Personal Hotspot␀␀␀␀minute␀␀minutes␀Never␀␀␀%d seconds␀␀Lock screen settings␀␀␀␀Auto lock␀␀␀Lock screen double-tap to
